// LEGACY H743 alias — no longer used by the smoke (FW723-RENODE).
// The flight MCU is STM32H723; use potok_stm32h723.repl, which is an explicit
// platform with the corrected H723 memory map. This file only names Renode's
// built-in H743 platform and is kept for provenance only.
//
// The built-in CPU platform is the authority for the STM32H743 register map;
// no peripheral is invented, remapped or stubbed here.
//
//   cpu        : Cortex-M7 at 0x00000000 ITCM / 0x08000000 flash
//   flashBank1 : 1 MiB at 0x08000000 (the smoke ELF is far smaller)
//   dtcm       : 128 KiB at 0x20000000 (result marker at 0x2001F800)
//   usart1     : 0x40011000, TX observed by the smoke script
//   watchdog   : 0x58004800, STM32 independent watchdog
//   rcc        : 0x58024400, STM32H7 reset/clock controller

using "platforms/cpus/stm32h743.repl"
